{"response":"For a $30,000 initial deposit, use the Navy Blue Business Checking referral. You would receive $100 if the LLC deposits at least $5,000 within 90 days of opening; the deposit must be new money and remain for the required period.

The Beige Account offers a higher $500 referral reward, but it requires an enterprise-level business to deposit at least $100,000 within 120 days, so the stated $30,000 funding would not qualify.

Your referral history shows your most recent completed referral was more than nine days ago, so the rolling nine-day limit does not appear to block this referral. The LLC must also be a new Rho-Bank customer, have a different primary owner from any existing Rho-Bank business account, and use only one promotional offer. Navy Blue requires you to have been a Rho-Bank checking customer for at least 60 days."}
